nss_qdisc: initialize NSS FQ-CoDel flow buckets and quantum

The firmware needs a positive DRR quantum and the real size of the flow
table. Supply the interface MTU for an omitted quantum. Query the bucket
size for FQ-CoDel even when the user accepts the default count, and keep
the full table size when changing an existing queue.

Match the map and unmap directions for firmware-owned flow state. Destroy
the firmware node if the bucket-size request fails during setup.

